From 4905ac1eefffd9bf1ffbae6a8ca566d18bb1ee8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stel777 <274792865+Stel777@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 22:30:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] feat(vaults): sortable brain list/grid

Add a sort control to the BrainSelector header (both list and grid views):
Name (A-Z), Date added, Recently changed, Most notes. Choice persists to
localStorage like the view toggle.

Backend: add last_modified_secs to BrainStats, computed free in the existing
vault walk (newest .md mtime), powering the Recently changed sort.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
